# Play test of Driftglass Bay (CIPlay driftglass_bay, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the landing
# beach at -1 0 (0.4 m) with the driftwood man; Pell's hut on the north horn (pad 4.8 m, deck 5.8 m, ladder at -6 24.9);
# the way up over the south horn and along the crest to the tower's pad (6 m); the bottle tower at 10 0, its ladder at 10 -1.9, the
# gallery 11.97 m; the eight bottles round the bay and under water
island Driftglass Bay
expect step 0
expect title The Bottle Light
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2
expect hidden lamplight
wait 5

# The landing: the driftwood man's bottle, the welcome board
walk -4 0 to -1.5 0 h=0.4
zone landing
expect step 1
read Pell's bottle, the driftwood man
read Welcome board
expect story bottle 1
# Pell's hut on the north horn: up its ladder; the bottle on the floor, his diary, the box below
walk -6 20 to -6 23.6 h=4.8
climb -6 24.9 h=4.8
expect stand -6 27 h=5.8 below=7
read Pell's bottle, the hut
read Pell's diary
expect step 2
open Pell's box
# The other six: the horns, the scrap whale, the bay's floor, the east reef, the north-west shallows
read Pell's bottle, the north horn
read Pell's bottle, the south horn
read Pell's bottle, the whale
read Pell's bottle, the bay
read Pell's bottle, the east reef
read Pell's bottle, the north-west shallows
expect story bottle 8
expect step 3

# Up the south horn and along the crest; the tower's ladder to the lamp; the lamp filled
walk -22 -27 to -15 -25 to -5 -24 to 3 -20 to 8 -12 to 8 -4 h=6
zone crest
walk 8 -3.5 to 10 -2.6 h=6
climb 10 -1.9 h=6
expect stand 10 -1 h=11.97 below=14
zone lamptop
expect step 4
use lamp
expect shown lamplight
expect story lamplit 1
expect story bottle 0
expect step 5
open Pell's chest
expect done
